"w": 380,
"text": "BUILT: working hours rule\n\n6 AM – 11 PM: everything is open.\n\nAfter 11 PM: only jobs and travel (bus seats, trips) stay listed and contactable, 24×7. Shops, doctors, stays and other posts are hidden until 6 AM.\n\nPartners can still post at night (sales, camp registrations); they go live at 6 AM.\n\nJobs and locals selling are shown only within 10 km (or the same pincode), never city-wide.",
"color": "orange",
"size": "m"
},
