"w": 380,
"text": "Theme: create business for locals.\nHome shows live deals, doctors & health camps, school/college admissions (pushed Jan–June), trips with free seats, jobs & part-time work, things locals sell, and businesses near you.\n\nLastPick is only a platform: it connects people and acts on providers through reviews and reports.",
